WEBVTT

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:00.956
It's practically gospel

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:03.366
in the world of work advice these days.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:04.833
"Be authentic."

00:02:05.384 --> 00:02:08.416
But what does it really
mean to be authentic?

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:10.952
And is it always the right choice?

00:02:10.976 --> 00:02:13.617
(WorkLife theme music)

00:02:18.184 --> 00:02:19.358
AG: I'm Adam Grant.

00:02:19.382 --> 00:02:22.076
And this is WorkLife,
my podcast with TED.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.346
I'm an organizational psychologist.

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:27.556
I study how to make work not suck.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.120
In this show, I'm inviting myself
inside the minds